- [The Rustonomicon](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nomicon/) - Unsafe Rust 공식 가이드
- [Miri GitHub 저장소](https://github.com/rust-lang/miri)
- [Rust Reference - FFI](https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/items/external-blocks.html)

